+ *            represented in Q0.15 format (defined in section 1.6.5). Given
+ *            that:
+ *                    -32768 = pTapsQ15(k) < 32768,
+ *                     0 = k <tapsLen,
+ *            the range on the actual filter coefficients is -1 = bK <1, and
+ *            therefore coefficient normalization may be required during the
